%% Transaction Ledger Approach - Immutable transaction log
sequenceDiagram
    participant ExternalSystem
    participant Transaction
    participant TransactionService
    participant Agent
    participant Model
    participant Agent2 as Agent B

    Note over Transaction: Balance = SUM(incoming) - SUM(outgoing) for each agent

    Note over ExternalSystem,Agent: Initial Dollar Grant
    ExternalSystem->>TransactionService: Grant 100 dollars to new agent
    TransactionService->>Transaction: CREATE Transaction<br/>(from=NULL, to=agent.id, amount=100, reason="initial_balance")

    Note over Agent,Model: Model Usage - Success
    Agent->>Model: Request LLM call
    Model->>TransactionService: Check balance >= 0?
    TransactionService-->>Model: Balance = 100 (✓ >= 0)

    Model->>Model: Make LLM call
    Model-->>Agent: Response<br/>(10 input tokens, 5 output tokens)

    Note over Model: Calculate cost:<br/>10 * 1 + 5 * 2 = 20 dollars
    Model->>TransactionService: Deduct 20 dollars from agent
    TransactionService->>Transaction: CREATE Transaction<br/>(from=agent.id, to=NULL, amount=20, reason="model_usage")
    Note over Transaction: Immutable record
    Note over Agent: Balance now = 80

    Note over Agent,Model: Model Usage - Goes Into Debt
    Agent->>Model: Request LLM call
    Model->>TransactionService: Check balance >= 0?
    TransactionService-->>Model: Balance = 80 (✓ >= 0)

    Model->>Model: Make LLM call
    Model-->>Agent: Response<br/>(100 input tokens, 50 output tokens)

    Note over Model: Calculate cost:<br/>100 * 1 + 50 * 2 = 200 dollars
    Model->>TransactionService: Deduct 200 dollars from agent
    TransactionService->>Transaction: CREATE Transaction<br/>(from=agent.id, to=NULL, amount=200, reason="model_usage")
    Note over Agent: Balance now = -120 (in debt!)

    Note over Agent,Model: Model Usage - Blocked (Agent In Debt)
    Agent->>Model: Request LLM call
    Model->>TransactionService: Check balance >= 0?
    TransactionService-->>Model: Balance = -120 (✗ < 0)
    Model-->>Agent: ERROR: Cannot make calls while in debt
    Note over Agent: Must earn dollars before making more calls

    Note over ExternalSystem,Agent: Task Reward - Recovering From Debt
    ExternalSystem->>TransactionService: Grant 100 dollars to agent
    TransactionService->>Transaction: CREATE Transaction<br/>(from=NULL, to=agent.id, amount=100, reason="task_reward", reference=task.id)
    Note over Agent: Balance now = -20 (still in debt, cannot make model calls)

    ExternalSystem->>TransactionService: Grant 50 dollars to agent (another task)
    TransactionService->>Transaction: CREATE Transaction<br/>(from=NULL, to=agent.id, amount=50, reason="task_reward", reference=task.id)
    Note over Agent: Balance now = 30 (out of debt! Can make model calls again)

    Note over Agent,Agent2: Agent Transfer - Success
    Agent->>TransactionService: Request transfer 20 dollars to Agent B
    TransactionService->>TransactionService: Query & validate: 30 >= 20 ✓
    TransactionService->>Transaction: CREATE Transaction<br/>(from=agent.id, to=agent2.id, amount=20, reason="transfer")
    Note over Agent: Balance now = 10
    Note over Agent2: Balance now = 20

    Note over Agent,Agent2: Agent Transfer - Blocked (In Debt)
    Note over Agent: Assume Agent is at balance = -30
    Agent->>TransactionService: Request transfer 10 dollars to Agent B
    TransactionService->>TransactionService: Query balance: -30 < 0
    TransactionService-->>Agent: ERROR: Cannot transfer while in debt
    Note over Agent,Agent2: No transaction created
